    │   monkey_patch() arguments differ slightly between the two libraries; some third-party C extensions may behave differently under 
    │   gevent vs eventlet
    ├── Constraints: requires_connector
    └── eventlet.monkey_patch() is called to enable cooperative multitasking for the Flask-SocketIO server. gevent provides the same 
        monkey-patching capability and is a supported async mode for Flask-SocketIO, making it a genuine drop-in alternative for this 
        specific use case.

